# WAITS ON: the Awakener's Orb with its donor as a second item (ROADMAP.md,
# multi-item crafts).
#
# Two influences on one body armour: an Awakener's Orb merge. The receiver is
# rolled while Magic, with alterations, until its one influence mod is the
# Redeemer aura effect; a Redeemer's Exalted Orb would add the influence to a
# plain base first. An Awakener's Orb then destroys a Hunter donor and reforges
# the receiver with both influences, keeping one influence mod from each item,
# so the donor's mods decide the result as much as the receiver's.

item {
    base:       "Vaal Regalia"
    ilvl:       86
    rarity:     normal
    influences: redeemer
}

transmute
until has "increased effect of non-curse auras" t1 and prefixCount == 0 {
    alteration
}
regal
awakener hunter

if prefixCount <= 2 and not has "maximum life" {
    bench "maximum life"
}
